---
system: sys-06-content-and-personalization
flow_id: content-pack-publish
surface: admin
spec_anchor: /software/systems/06-content-and-personalization#content-pack-format-and-loading
actors: [AdminConsole, ContentService, S3, PostgreSQL, Redis, InvalidationWorker]
apis: []
externals: [S3, Redis]
queues:
  - cp-content-publish
failure_paths:
  - checksum_mismatch
  - template_validation_failed
  - s3_get_failed
  - postgres_sync_failed
  - cache_invalidation_dlq
idempotency: per (packKey, version) — pack version is immutable once published; re-publish requires new version
retry: invalidate-content-cache immediate, 10s, 1m — DLQ after 3 failures
timeout: S3 GetObject 30s — load and sync end-to-end 60s
status: final
---
%% HAND-AUTHORED — sys-06 §"Content Pack Format and Loading" + §"Async Jobs and Queues" (no sequenceDiagram in spec).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AdminConsole
    participant ContentService
    participant S3
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant Redis
    participant InvalidationWorker

    AdminConsole->>ContentService: publish request {packKey, version, locale}
    alt s3_get_failed
        ContentService->>S3: GetObject packs/{locale}/{packKey}/v{version}.json
        S3--xContentService: 404 or 5xx
        ContentService-->>AdminConsole: 502 s3_unavailable
    else checksum_mismatch
        ContentService->>S3: GetObject
        S3-->>ContentService: bundle bytes
        ContentService->>ContentService: parse and recompute sha256(templates)
        Note over ContentService: bundle.checksum != computed
        ContentService-->>AdminConsole: 422 checksum_mismatch
    else template_validation_failed
        ContentService->>S3: GetObject
        S3-->>ContentService: bundle
        ContentService->>ContentService: validate each template (id 1-20, category, age_bands, weights 1-1000, tags<=10)
        Note over ContentService: invalid templates rejected per validation rules
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: upsert only valid templates
        ContentService-->>AdminConsole: 207 partial {errors[], templateCount}
    else postgres_sync_failed
        ContentService->>S3: GetObject
        S3-->>ContentService: bundle
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: upsert templates batch
        PostgreSQL--xContentService: error
        ContentService-->>AdminConsole: 502 postgres_sync_failed
    else cache_invalidation_dlq
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: upsert templates
        ContentService->>Redis: SET content:published:{packKey}:{version} (EX 3600)
        Redis-->>ContentService: OK
        ContentService-)ContentService: emit cp-content-publish
        InvalidationWorker--xPostgres: DLQ after 3 failures
    else success
        ContentService->>S3: GetObject
        S3-->>ContentService: bundle
        ContentService->>ContentService: validate checksum and each template
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: upsert templates batch (packKey, version)
        ContentService->>Redis: SET content:published:{packKey}:{version} (EX 3600)
        ContentService-)ContentService: emit cp-content-publish
        InvalidationWorker->>Redis: DEL stale cache keys (any older version)
        Redis-->>InvalidationWorker: OK
        ContentService-->>AdminConsole: 200 {templateCount}
    end
    Note over AdminConsole,InvalidationWorker: published packs are IMMUTABLE — updates require new version — retirement preserves snapshot auditability
